# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, as the repo stores it, on Windows too, where
# git's installer turns core.autocrlf on. clang-format's settings ask for LF (.clang-format), and its
# check fails on every line of a file checked out with CRLF. Git tells binary files by their content.
* text=auto eol=lf
